<decisions #fix-conversation-generation-sequence-replay apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { track = "fix-conversation-generation-sequence-replay" } (
  <decision #fix-conversation-generation-sequence-replay.canonical-order { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
    <question ?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YE>
    Conversation generation 应使用哪个字段恢复消息顺序？
    </?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YE>
    <answer {  } (
      <raw-answer ?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YF>
      用户确认按调查方案创建并实施修复 track。
      </?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YF>
      <decision-text ?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YG>
      完整 sequence metadata 存在时以 HistoryMessage.sequence 为权威顺序；仅对 sequence 不完整的 legacy generation 使用 committedAt fallback。
      </?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YG>
      <rationale ?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YH>
      现有 committedAt 混合 wall-clock milliseconds 与 generation ordinal，而 sequence 在故障 generation 中完整连续。
      </?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YH>
      <evidence ?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YJ>
      Auto_LIFE.OS incident generation records ::0 through ::408 and production loader comparison.
      </?01M05F1PNBHD69TP2M77W9R4YJ>
    )>
  )>
)>
